{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_st03",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_st03",
  "title": "行走于大地之上",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-3",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st03.txt",
  "sourceHash": "77b89c268d0a8d1af3269a72f79c25cd15ce3cf141bad711513743cc1c815904",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "半个月后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感谢你们的付出，科恩、库兹、蒂娜、亚历山大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我谨代表......长泉镇的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，我还不太擅长使用这种措辞和人说话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多亏了你们，我才能从弟弟手里活下来，我的领民也能重新回到自己的土地上生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "这只是我们应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我们引发了这场危机，所以我们有义务将其终结。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果不是我那无可救药的弟弟，一切都不会发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我本想为你们准备报酬的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，如你们所见，整个长泉镇已经毁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剩下的资产，我想全部投入到镇子的复兴上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现金酬劳......可能没法支付给你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这座房子里，只要有你们想要的东西，尽管拿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最好把它全拆了搬走，这样我就能和活下来的人一起建造新的长泉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "关于这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "亚历山大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "这头盔挺合身的，我能留着么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "嗯哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "的确，甲片亮到能闪瞎眼睛，我想给盾上也安一个，以后就用不着电池了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "这件事情的结果，我们都很满意，已经足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这，不需要更多的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的武器、父亲的其他收藏，你们都可以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "不用这么客气，你或许更需要这些东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮加尔",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_159_1#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "走吧各位，我们该离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "库兹先生，各位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_155_1#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们终于出来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_166",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "和领主小姐道别完了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "那我们也该离开这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的小队会护送你们回岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "speakerToken": "char_503_rang",
      "operatorId": "char_503_rang",
      "portraitKey": "char_503_rang",
      "text": "有劳了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "科恩小姐，您的小队将会与我们同行，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "是，我和我的队员已经战斗太久了，他们需要一个能够休息和进行补给的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "最重要的，我们可能需要身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "一个行走在这个世界……不，行走在这片“大地”上的身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "stormeye",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_167",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "车已经就位了，我们出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "各位的信息已经录入罗德岛终端了，以后可以在大地各处的罗德岛办事处或安全屋进行逗留与补给。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "虽然各位并非罗德岛的正式雇员，但任务网络已向各位开放，各位可以通过承接任务来获得报酬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "大致情况就是这样，各位还有什么想要知道的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "稍等，我能问一问，罗德岛上有哪儿能看到科幻小说吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "人事干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "什么？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "所以，这就是我们的新身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "至少我的盾能用了，还不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜华",
      "speakerToken": "char_458_rfrost_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "portraitKey": "char_458_rfrost",
      "text": "有什么计划吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "尝试去看看这片大地吧，我们对这个世界还了解得太少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我也希望能有份详尽的计划书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "但这一次，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "我们只能依靠自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "speakerToken": "char_457_blitz_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_457_blitz",
      "portraitKey": "char_457_blitz",
      "text": "所以我们的第一个目的地是哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "speakerToken": "char_456_ash_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_456_ash",
      "portraitKey": "char_456_ash",
      "text": "有一个叫汐斯塔的地方，听起来是个很不错的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "那就走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "speakerToken": "char_459_tachak_1",
      "operatorId": "char_459_tachak",
      "portraitKey": "char_459_tachak",
      "text": "在回到家之前，我们终究还在路上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
